  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding Micro and SME Lending in Semi-Urban and Rural Areas Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB will provide debt financing to AU by subscribing to up to $75 million (in Indian rupee equivalent) of senior unsecured nonconvertible debentures (NCDs) having recourse to AU&amp;apos;s balance sheet. At least 50% of the funding will target less developed states, as classified in the Raghuram Rajan Panel Report, 2013.</narrative>
  </description>
